# Generated SQL migrations land here and are committed.
#
# Two kinds live side by side:
#   - files drizzle-kit generates from src/schema
#   - hand-written SQL for things Drizzle does not model: the movement
#     immutability trigger, the derived views, and the REVOKE on the app role
#
# This folder, not the TypeScript, is the real source of truth for the
# database. Never run db:push against anything holding real stock — it
# resolves constraint drift by offering to truncate.
